const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文引入消费习惯形成，探讨它如何改变风险厌恶与股票溢价问题的解释。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“Habit Formation: A Resolution of the Equity Premium Puzzle” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/261693",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"理论模型让效用取决于消费相对于习惯水平的位置，再推导资产回报所需承担的风险补偿。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “Habit Formation: A Resolution of the Equity Premium Puzzle”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/261693",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"关键量是消费、习惯状态、偏好参数和资产回报；习惯本身是模型状态而非直接可见的数据列。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “Habit Formation: A Resolution of the Equity Premium Puzzle”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/261693",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"该机制展示偏好动态可改变风险补偿的含义，并不是以单一历史样本直接证明习惯在现实中被观测到。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “Habit Formation: A Resolution of the Equity Premium Puzzle”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/261693",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"分开记录效用设定、状态演化、校准目标和样本期，避免把校准匹配误认为结构因果识别。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “Habit Formation: A Resolution of the Equity Premium Puzzle”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/261693",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Political Economy (1990)。机制的解释力依赖模型设定，不能从标题直接推出任何市场时点的预期收益。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Political Economy (1990) for “Habit Formation: A Resolution of the Equity Premium Puzzle”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/261693",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1990) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Habit Formation: A Resolution of the Equity Premium Puzzle”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。机制的解释力依赖模型设定，不能从标题直接推出任何市场时点的预期收益。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Habit Formation: A Resolution of the Equity Premium Puzzle”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
